    "scope": [
      "Call the actual production accepted_metadata_ready predicate at success ages 0/6500/6501, backwards clock, no-success, active health/metadata and failed health/metadata/owner cases.",
      "Exercise the actual callback plus accepted runtime once with a non-watchdog owned pipe FD: healthy trial+core7+fresh cache accepts; unhealthy/stale-core/busy cases refuse; accepted core failure and metadata failure remain sticky.",
      "Exercise only the newly added purpose operations using an isolated root/native namespace socket: stale/wrong-boot/replayed/cross-purpose token refuses; actual callback must succeed before the server reports acceptance.",
      "A targeted same-owner transition observation must show accepted mode continues without further LAN ACK while metadata checks and core observations continue; this is new behavior and old fixture receipts do not validate it."
    ]
  },
